## Key Finding

The automated acquisition was limited by:
1. Internet Archive individual item downloads timing out (the collection has 84 items but only the main item's PDF was downloadable)
2. Wikimedia Commons thumbnail URLs returning redirects instead of actual files
3. Library of Congress API not returning downloadable image URLs

**The operator must manually download the remaining NIST NCSTAR reports.** The full collection (84 items) is the single highest-value acquisition and would increase overall readiness from ~5% to ~30%.

