## Recommended Next Steps

1. **Manual NIST download** — Visit `https://archive.org/details/NIST_WTC_Investigation_Reports-861612` and download all NCSTAR 1-1 through 1-9 PDFs
2. **Manual Wikimedia download** — Download full-resolution site plan SVGs from Wikimedia Commons file pages
3. **Manual LoC search** — Search `https://www.loc.gov/pictures/collection/gsc/?q=World+Trade+Center` for construction photographs
4. **Manual IA uploader inspection** — Visit `https://archive.org/details/AA20a1` and inspect uploader's other collections for Tower B structural sheets